---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
import { langText } from '../../lib/i18n';
const es = 'en';
---
<BaseLayout title={langText(es, 'privacy.title')} description={langText(es, 'about.privacy')} lang="en">
  <div class="page-simple container">
    <Breadcrumbs lang="en" items={[{ label: langText(es, 'privacy.title') }]} />

    <h1 class="page-title">{langText(es, 'privacy.title')}</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">{langText(es, 'about.privacy')}</p>

      <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
      <p>We do not create accounts or collect personal data through registration forms. The calculators work entirely in your browser: the figures you enter are never sent to our servers.</p>

      <h2>2. Cookies and advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
      <p>We display ads through <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Google and its partners may use cookies (such as Google's double-click cookies) to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other websites.</p>
      <p>You can see how Google uses data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's partner policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>3. How to opt out of personalized advertising</h2>
      <p>You can opt out of personalized Google ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also configure your browser to reject cookies or warn you before installing them.</p>

      <h2>4. Web analytics</h2>
      <p>We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to analyse site usage and improve it. This tool is only
        activated when you give <strong>explicit consent</strong> through the cookie banner. Google Analytics
        uses its own cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_gid</code>, <code>_gat</code>) and may collect information
        such as your IP address (anonymised), pages visited, time on site and referral source. See
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a>
        for details.</p>

      <h2>5. Local storage and cookies</h2>
      <p>We use your browser's local storage (localStorage) to save three preferences: your language,
        visual theme (light/dark) and your cookie consent choice. This information is stored exclusively
        in your browser and is never sent to any server.</p>
      <p>If you give consent, Google Analytics cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_gid</code>,
        <code>_gat</code>) and/or Google AdSense cookies (<code>_gads</code>, <code>IDE</code>) are set
        according to your preferences. You can change or revoke your consent at any time by clicking
        <strong>Cookie settings</strong> in the footer.</p>

      <h2>6. Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
      <p>Since all calculators process data locally in your browser and we do not store personal data
        on any server, there is no information to request, rectify, or delete from our database.
        For any privacy questions, write to us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy. Changes will be published on this page with their revision date. Last revision: 16 September 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>